      "id": "nt",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 810,
      "width": 1329.3,
      "height": 40.0,
      "text": "Note: Inbound traffic from the internet reaches only as far as the ALB in the public subnet.\nApp servers and RDS sit in private subnets, so nothing outside can connect to them directly; only outbound traffic passes through NAT.",
      "originalText": "Note: Inbound traffic from the internet reaches only as far as the ALB in the public subnet.\nApp servers and RDS sit in private subnets, so nothing outside can connect to them directly; only outbound traffic passes through NAT.",
